WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Planning your meals for the week doesn't need to take time. With Foodie-do, you can generate a full plan in seconds.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.500
Let's jump in.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Once you're signed in, you'll land on your dashboard.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.500
From here, head to the meal planner.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Choose your preferences - things like how many meals you want to plan.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.000
And generate your weekly plan in one click.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.500
Foodie-do creates a balanced, varied plan instantly - no repeats, no overthinking.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.500
You can quickly scan through each day.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Not feeling something? Just swap it out for another recipe.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.500
Once you're happy, save your plan.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:47.500
And that's it - your week is planned and ready to go.
